            },
            "reviewBody": "If everyone you're cooking for says they only want one ear, make them two anyway! They'll be begging you for more corn AND the recipe! Also great with garlic powder instead of or along with the chili powder."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
